stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PreOperationReview
    PreOperationReview --> ReadyForSupervisedMovement: Safety case, route, sensors, signage, and accessibility checks pass
    PreOperationReview --> DoNotOperate: Required evidence missing or path is not accessible
    ReadyForSupervisedMovement --> SlowMove: Protective field clear and route condition acceptable
    SlowMove --> ProtectiveStop: Person, animal, obstacle, or uncertain condition in protective radius
    SlowMove --> SurfaceReview: Wet, damaged, steep, obstructed, or uncertain surface
    SlowMove --> EmergencyStop: Accessible emergency stop activated or critical sensor state fails
    ProtectiveStop --> HumanReview: Object persists or sensor evidence conflicts
    SurfaceReview --> HumanReview: Route safety or accessibility continuity is uncertain
    EmergencyStop --> HumanReview: Reset requires authorized safety review
    HumanReview --> PreOperationReview: Review records a safe next state
    DoNotOperate --> PreOperationReview: New evidence or route review is available
